abstract: "Code and retained analytical outputs for observational comparisons of fire, tree-cover loss and agricultural expansion across Upemba National Park's legal boundary during changing territorial control, including supplementary spatial and temporal dependence checks. Derived environmental inputs support reproduction of the additional sensitivity analyses; upstream external-input requirements and licence scope are documented in the repository."
